*******************************************************
Nginx Proxy Manager (NPM) for AWS — by Northstar Cloud Solutions
Unauthorized access is prohibited. All activity may be
monitored and logged.

First-boot checklist:
- Admin URL: http://<instance-ip>:81
- Retrieve credentials: sudo npm-helper show-creds
- Open ports by default: 22, 80, 443
- Admin UI port 81: restrict to trusted IP or use SSH tunnel
  (sudo npm-helper admin-access enable --cidr <your-ip>/32)

Documentation: https://northstarcloud.io/docs/npm-ami
*******************************************************
